            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "du3Lb",
              "name": "Para",
              "fill": "$prose",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Most APIs only let you call them so many times a minute. That's fine when one part of your app is calling. It gets tricky when everything is: people placing orders, the app refreshing prices, and background jobs catching up.",
              "lineHeight": "$leading-body",
              "fontFamily": "$ui",
              "fontSize": "$text-body",
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "oHPA8",
              "name": "Space",
              "width": 1,
              "height": 20
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "u2eNo",
              "name": "Para",
              "fill": "$prose",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "If they all share one budget and nobody's in charge, the loudest caller wins. Usually that's a background job, and the person tapping a button waits.",
              "lineHeight": "$leading-body",
              "fontFamily": "$ui",
              "fontSize": "$text-body",
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "G64PQN",
              "name": "Space",
              "width": 1,
              "height": 48
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "EdOhA",
              "name": "H2",
              "fill": "$fg",
              "content": "Give every caller a lane",
              "lineHeight": "$leading-h2",
              "fontFamily": "$ui",
              "fontSize": "$text-h2",
              "fontWeight": "500",
              "letterSpacing": -0.3
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "NhCdO",
              "name": "Space",
              "width": 1,
              "height": 16
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "HXzNb",
              "name": "Para",
              "fill": "$prose",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "The fix is a small service in the middle. Every request goes through it. It knows the total budget, splits it into lanes, and lets the most important lane go first.",
              "lineHeight": "$leading-body",
              "fontFamily": "$ui",
              "fontSize": "$text-body",
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
