              "fill": "$muted",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "The footer signature is a font (Sign Style), not a drawn path, so a true stroke-by-stroke trace needs a hand-made path. Cheap version that reads the same on one line: a left-to-right reveal with a soft pen-tip edge, 900ms, once when the footer scrolls into view; hover replays it.",
